  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training - Clean Energy Exchange Program, through Koeppen, Elliot &amp; Associates, Ltd.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA is funding a fourth phase of the Clean Energy Exchange Program to introduce Chinese energy sector officials and project sponsors to U.S. clean energy technologies. The Program includes a series of three separate and distinct reverse trade missions (RTMs) to the United States. The series of RTMs supports the mission of the U.S.-China Energy Cooperation Program (ECP.)</narrative>
  </description>
